  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nAccording to the question, **by interchanging the given two signs and numbers :**\n\n \n• **+ and –**\n \n• **2 and 4**\n\n​So,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 9 – 5 ÷ 4 × 2 + 8 = 80\n\n​9 + **5 ÷ 2**__ × 4 - 8 = 80\n\n9 + __**2.5 × 4**__ - 8 = 80\n\n__**9 + 10**__ - 8 = 80\n\n__**19 - 8**__ = 80\n\n**11 ≠ 80 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 7 × 4 – 2 ÷ 1 + 5 = 13\n\n7 × 2 + **4 ÷ 1**__ - 5 = 13\n\n__**7 × 2**__ + 4 - 5 = 13\n\n__**14 + 4**__ - 5 = 13\n\n__**18 - 5**__ = 13\n\n**13 = 13 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 7 – 8 ÷ 2 + 16 × 4 = 18\n\n​7 + **8 ÷ 4**__ - 16 × 2 = 18\n\n7 + 2 - __**16 × 2**__ = 18 \n\n__**7 + 2**__ - 32 = 18\n\n__**14 - 32**__ = 18\n\n**-18 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 5 + 7 × 4 – 8 ÷ 2 = 5\n\n​5 - 7 × 2 + **8 ÷ 4**__ = 5\n\n5 - __**7 × 2**__ + 2 = 5\n\n__**5 + 2**__ - 14 = 5\n\n__**7 - 14**__ = 5\n\n**-7 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.\n\n45:T18",
